From 2fccfdcf9db31fc0e9e80268b6068040fec13168 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 03:25:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] Seer: find and clean duplicate songs, and stop making
 them

Album requests that already have files on disk are not downloaded again,
Soulseek imports replace earlier copies of a track, and library matching
ignores punctuation (MusicBrainz's Unicode hyphens). Admins get a
"Clean up duplicates" button that moves extra Seer copies to a trash
folder kept for 7 days.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

